  "content": "\n\n<blockquote>\n  <h2>mewo 的魔法鏡</h2>\n  <h3>一款獨特實作《泰拉瑞亞》魔法鏡物品的模組</h3>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66632b39871b7be12ff8f9b1538e35833e489135.png\" alt=\"物品展示框中的魔法鏡\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>加入我們的 Discord 以獲取模組更新、預告等最新消息！（點擊）</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mEYDh4SUWN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9cea9cd7dc8511b56c21d5eef30b040a9f9f81d2.png\" alt=\"Discord 橫幅圖片\"></a></p>\n<h1>此模組已停止維護！</h1>\n<h3>摘要</h3>\n<blockquote>\n  <h4>魔法鏡</h4>\n</blockquote>\n<p>這是模組中唯一的物品，需使用 4 個鐵錠、2 個鐵塊與 1 顆鑽石合成。激活魔法鏡會暫時降低移動速度，經過短暫延遲後，將你傳送至重生點（若未設置床則傳送至世界重生點），並施加數秒的失明效果，隨後進入長時間冷卻。不過，這面鏡子無法在地獄或終界中使用：地獄會抑制其傳送能力；而終界方面，離開終界的唯一途徑應為終界傳送門，故維持此設定。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/66632b39871b7be12ff8f9b1538e35833e489135.png\" alt=\"物品展示框中的魔法鏡\"></p>\n<h3>問與答</h3>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>問：您會更新此模組嗎？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>答：不會，此模組已停止開發。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>問：我可以將其用於我的整合包中嗎？</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>答：我不建議，但可以。</p>\n<h3>歡迎查看我的其他模組！</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fextra-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a999856e189e9910f71f97b6752a9cb969b1dde6.png\" alt=\"額外進度 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wolfys-ring-of-flight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c112eee024035b195d5a234272abba6c598494e7.png\" alt=\"飛行戒指 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-expanded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8f6fda41186241f719ef6bd4351817279346ec77.png\" alt=\"新生物擴充 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7e7f9727c078c9b09bd71dc74466dc78ed20473a.png\" alt=\"Mystica 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/runestones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/744f4e38045fd76f9d405b210cede837e7b9e15e.png\" alt=\"符文石 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wolfys-extra-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88ecc3da1b7a721f6fe7093bc3b6c3a087f92427.png\" alt=\"Wolfys 額外擴充 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/demolitions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0d3b8a492f949ee5c89ca5d996e4af639cb18bbc.png\" alt=\"爆破 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charms-and-medallions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7413da591bdcad32d93163a09954b6384824d5d1.png\" alt=\"護符與徽章 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skeleton-uprising\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/43c403e8067c5c6f6ee1306984c8719e187453f8.png\" alt=\"骷髏叛亂 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/basic-loot-bags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a03ec805abf083b22228752ead56a9b264825069.png\" alt=\"基礎戰利品袋 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additions-and-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891a1f575f6e7ec2199e788d671f37560df1a383.png\" alt=\"附加內容與更多 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arcanic-armaments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7dced5fde95557814ccf077dc90058438274e31b.png\" alt=\"奧術武裝 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos-forgotten-content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0208577b79cfb018595a6ea2c522b2ae69632fc.png\" alt=\"混沌起源：遺忘內容 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-charms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3982d5805a631af3439982b2a68dceeacf2f17e.png\" alt=\"生物護符 標誌\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/density\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/beb6e83aa5978a5f309bece423271111d7d07aa8.png\" alt=\"密度 標誌\"></a></p>",
